OL,3,GNEWSACalls to remove liveable
OL,4,Aneighbourhood road
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people are calling for a
OL,7,Froad to be reopened to traffic after
OL,8,Fdamage to a nearby tunnel caused
OL,9,Ffurther disruption on a major route.
OL,11,FMore than 860 people have signed a
OL,12,Fpetition demanding motorists be able to
OL,13,Fuse Sydney Road in Bath, which was
OL,14,Fclosed to traffic in 2024 as part of
OL,15,Fthe city's liveable neighbourhoods
OL,16,Fscheme.
OL,18,FThe petitioners say a single-lane
OL,19,Fclosure on the alternative A36 Beckford
OL,20,FRoad, after contractors accidentally
OL,21,Fbroke through the roof of a canal
OL,22,Ftunnel, has meant long queues.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
