OL,5,
OL,6,FA Bath and North East Somerset Council
OL,7,Fspokesperson said safety was its
OL,8,F"priority" and engineers were closely
OL,9,Fmonitoring the bridge, but the lane and
OL,10,Fbridge closure would continue.
